    "sections": {
        "description": "The Consultancy Firm Theme is a powerful and professional solution designed for modern consulting businesses. Whether you’re in business consultancy, strategy consulting, or HR consulting, this theme offers everything you need to build a credible online presence. Ideal for firms specializing in management consulting, financial consulting, IT consulting, legal consulting, or tax consulting, it features a sleek layout, intuitive navigation, and full customization options tailored to your branding needs. Perfect for branding consultancy, startup consulting, risk assessment consultancy, compliance advisory website, corporate strategy firm, project management consulting, business growth, and market research, this theme supports services ranging from digital consulting and project management to sales consulting, risk management, and compliance consulting. Built for business strategy, organizational development, and process improvement, it also serves technology consulting, data analytics consulting, investment consulting, and business advisory. Additional features include support for real estate consulting, business planning, financial strategy, corporate consulting, and SME consulting. Ideal for change management, staffing consultancy, recruitment agencies, and talent acquisition, it also caters to leadership training, HR solutions, and employee retention. Grow your firm with built-in options for SEO consulting, brand strategy, content consulting, PR consulting, digital strategy, and more. Whether offering business coaching, ERP consulting, or compliance advisory, this theme helps your consultancy thrive."
    },
